Mama!

01:27:40.766 --> 01:27:42.668
♪ Take a load off, Fanny ♪

01:27:43.935 --> 01:27:45.771
♪ Take a load for free ♪

01:27:47.305 --> 01:27:49.675
♪ Take a load off, Fanny ♪

01:27:51.109 --> 01:27:52.678
♪ And... ♪

01:32:01.126 --> 01:32:02.828
Hey, you're through
to Charlie Cannon.

01:32:02.961 --> 01:32:04.195
I can't get to the phone
right now.

01:32:04.329 --> 01:32:05.831
Please leave a message.

01:32:05.964 --> 01:32:07.565
Charlie, it's Zaki.

01:32:07.699 --> 01:32:10.268
I, uh... I have to come see you.

01:32:10.401 --> 01:32:12.871
There's something
I need to show you.

01:33:34.820 --> 01:33:36.221
Dad, Mom's looking for you.

01:33:39.424 --> 01:33:40.291
Dad!

01:33:41.927 --> 01:33:42.894
She needs you.

01:33:55.707 --> 01:33:56.574
Hey.

01:33:58.509 --> 01:33:59.978
She's calm right now.

01:34:01.112 --> 01:34:02.981
Seb's outside the door.

01:34:03.815 --> 01:34:06.017
I'll go back up in a few minutes
and check on her.

01:34:11.990 --> 01:34:14.059
I don't want her here anymore.

01:34:16.161 --> 01:34:17.829
I know. I know.

01:34:18.463 --> 01:34:19.998
It doesn't feel real.

01:34:21.767 --> 01:34:24.369
But we just gotta
get through this, okay?

01:34:26.371 --> 01:34:28.173
This is what your mom
would have wanted.

01:34:32.811 --> 01:34:34.880
I'm not talking about my mom.

01:35:08.980 --> 01:35:10.849
Don't go, baby brother.

01:35:14.252 --> 01:35:18.089
Please let me out so I can join
the big, happy party downstairs.

01:35:19.690 --> 01:35:21.559
Why are they hiding me away?

01:35:22.727 --> 01:35:25.363
I really miss being a part
of the family, Seb.

01:35:34.339 --> 01:35:35.340
Do you remember the day that

01:35:35.473 --> 01:35:36.474
you threw Veronica off the roof

01:35:36.607 --> 01:35:37.809
to see if she could fly?

01:35:39.777 --> 01:35:41.079
You're the one that gave me
the idea

01:35:41.212 --> 01:35:43.081
to see if Granny could fly.

01:35:43.314 --> 01:35:44.515
It's all your fault
she's rotting

01:35:44.649 --> 01:35:45.984
in that coffin down there.

01:35:49.287 --> 01:35:50.455
Stop! Stop!

01:36:53.651 --> 01:36:54.652
Sweetheart?

01:36:55.453 --> 01:36:56.321
What's wrong?

01:37:03.494 --> 01:37:04.062
Maud?

01:37:15.941 --> 01:37:16.741
Maud!

01:37:20.145 --> 01:37:21.412
Hold her!

01:39:00.245 --> 01:39:01.346
Where are we going?

01:39:02.647 --> 01:39:05.150
We're going somewhere safe.

01:39:05.283 --> 01:39:06.551
Is Katie coming?

01:39:07.585 --> 01:39:09.387
No. Not right now.

01:39:11.589 --> 01:39:13.024
Why are you so bad at this?

01:39:13.158 --> 01:39:16.027
Because we are in a rush, Maud.
Okay?

01:39:17.628 --> 01:39:20.198
No. At being my mom.

01:39:48.626 --> 01:39:51.429
I wish I didn't have to show you
what's on this tape.

01:39:53.464 --> 01:39:56.867
But it's very important you see
what happened to Katie.

01:40:08.746 --> 01:40:11.549
This is the woman
who kidnapped your daughter.

01:40:17.855 --> 01:40:22.227
"The dark signs have begun
to show once more.

01:40:23.494 --> 01:40:25.396
Warning us
that the time has come

01:40:25.530 --> 01:40:28.032
to recommit to the containment

01:40:28.299 --> 01:40:31.102
of our ancient family secret.

01:40:33.003 --> 01:40:34.839
This will be the...

01:40:37.542 --> 01:40:40.845
...82nd mummification ritual.

01:40:41.512 --> 01:40:43.748
And as the first-born child,

01:40:43.881 --> 01:40:49.954
I am honored to carry this
great responsibility of ensuring

01:40:50.087 --> 01:40:53.458
that our family
will remain protected

01:40:53.591 --> 01:40:56.894
from the evil reach
of the Nasmaranian.

01:40:59.364 --> 01:41:03.734
I commit this testament
so that in decades to come,

01:41:05.803 --> 01:41:08.339
your children will know
what they must do

01:41:08.473 --> 01:41:11.676
when it is their time
to transfer this demon...

01:41:14.212 --> 01:41:16.080
from a spent vessel...

01:41:18.383 --> 01:41:21.952
...to a freshly prepared host."

01:41:31.028 --> 01:41:32.930
"An innocent child is best.

01:41:33.898 --> 01:41:36.401
The body lasts longest.

01:41:37.568 --> 01:41:39.337
But any live human will do."

01:41:56.521 --> 01:41:58.956
"Let us begin."

01:42:20.811 --> 01:42:23.348
Please. I wanna go home.

01:42:31.256 --> 01:42:33.724
This will all be over soon,
Katie.

01:42:34.925 --> 01:42:36.227
I promise.

01:42:38.028 --> 01:42:40.164
I want my mommy and my daddy.

01:42:56.247 --> 01:42:58.182
No! No!

01:42:59.484 --> 01:43:00.451
No, please!

01:43:02.853 --> 01:43:05.523
Hey. I don't--
I don't wanna know.

01:43:05.656 --> 01:43:06.691
I don't wanna know.

01:43:06.824 --> 01:43:09.193
We have to know.
We have to know.

01:43:14.231 --> 01:43:18.235
Please! No! Let me go! Stop!

01:43:21.939 --> 01:43:24.442
No! Stop!

01:43:26.577 --> 01:43:28.012
Baby brother?

01:43:29.246 --> 01:43:30.348
Yes?

01:43:32.249 --> 01:43:34.419
Wanna come help me
get undressed?

01:43:37.322 --> 01:43:38.356
Yes.

01:43:39.890 --> 01:43:41.926
Please let me go!

01:43:42.660 --> 01:43:43.861
No!

01:44:13.891 --> 01:44:14.859
No!

01:44:21.265 --> 01:44:22.500
No!

01:44:23.568 --> 01:44:24.969
Let me go!

01:47:26.617 --> 01:47:28.352
That thing they put inside her

01:47:29.854 --> 01:47:31.789
was meant to stay buried
and bound.

01:47:39.163 --> 01:47:39.930
Charlie.

01:47:54.612 --> 01:47:57.982
Katie. Katie, Mommy's coming.
Mommy's coming.

01:48:00.317 --> 01:48:02.820
Wait. Wait, Katie. Wait, baby.

01:48:02.953 --> 01:48:04.188
Charlie!

01:48:26.410 --> 01:48:27.444
Katie.

01:48:42.793 --> 01:48:43.861
Katie!

01:49:11.689 --> 01:49:13.057
Hey, Charlie.

01:49:14.124 --> 01:49:15.793
Do you wanna feast on me?

01:49:17.527 --> 01:49:18.896
Come on.

01:49:19.964 --> 01:49:21.999
Taste it.

01:49:29.039 --> 01:49:29.840
Katie!

01:49:31.108 --> 01:49:32.743
Charlie!

01:49:34.278 --> 01:49:35.312
Katie!

01:51:45.709 --> 01:51:48.212
I'm not very comfortable
inside your daughter.

01:52:06.430 --> 01:52:09.133
You used to play chase with me.

01:52:09.699 --> 01:52:10.767
Now you just wriggle away

01:52:10.901 --> 01:52:12.036
from me like you're a worm.

01:52:24.314 --> 01:52:26.350
You're never getting her back!

01:52:26.917 --> 01:52:29.019
I'm her daddy now.

01:54:13.157 --> 01:54:15.993
Zaki! The words!
Remember the words!

01:56:11.007 --> 01:56:12.109
I'm sorry.

01:57:16.240 --> 01:57:17.541
Mom?

01:57:22.812 --> 01:57:23.780
Katie?

01:57:26.450 --> 01:57:27.551
Dad?

01:58:06.623 --> 01:58:08.825
Come on, sweetheart.
Let's go back upstairs.

01:58:20.604 --> 01:58:21.971
What is he saying?

01:58:24.808 --> 01:58:26.276
He says he loves us.

01:58:32.081 --> 01:58:33.350
We love you, Dad.

01:58:49.666 --> 01:58:51.368
No, let her go. It's her turn.

01:59:18.462 --> 01:59:19.229
Hello?

01:59:20.464 --> 01:59:21.398
It's me.

01:59:22.999 --> 01:59:24.801
It's late for you.

01:59:24.934 --> 01:59:26.570
I don't really sleep.

01:59:29.873 --> 01:59:30.940
Me neither.

01:59:33.477 --> 01:59:35.612
I need to talk to you
about Charlie.

01:59:39.215 --> 01:59:40.550
I'm listening.

02:01:35.965 --> 02:01:37.567
You know my face.

02:01:43.707 --> 02:01:45.709
You remember my Katie,
don't you?

02:01:51.481 --> 02:01:54.050
She wants to know
if you'd like to see a trick.
